  "intro": {
    "text": "To say **was** or **were**, add `-(y)DI` and the past endings: *evde* → *evdeydim* (I was at home), *yorgun* → *yorgundu* (he was tired). After a vowel comes the buffer y; after f, s, t, k, ç, ş, h, p the d becomes t: *Hava sıcaktı*.",
    "see": "gp-past-copula"
  },
